287
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:34.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">چەند؟</font>

288
00:19:35.167 --> 00:19:36.833
<font face="Comic Sans MS">بەندە بە ئەوەی چەند دڵخۆشیت!</font>

289
00:20:01.875 --> 00:20:02.875
<font face="Comic Sans MS">ئەوە زۆر جوانە!</font>

290
00:20:27.583 --> 00:20:28.542
<font face="Comic Sans MS">هێرۆ!</font>

291
00:20:37.583 --> 00:20:38.292
<font face="Comic Sans MS">هێرۆ!</font>

